{"seq":1,"slug":"length-extrapolation","title":"长度外推之难：为什么 RoPE 出了训练长度就崩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/extrapolation/length-extrapolation","wordCount":1368,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"长度外推之难-为什么-rope-出了训练长度就崩\">长度外推之难：为什么 RoPE 出了训练长度就崩</h1><p>给一个在 4K 上训练的 Llama 直接喂进 16K 的文档，它多半会输出困惑度飙升、逐渐语无伦次的结果。奇怪的是 RoPE 明明&quot;只依赖相对距离&quot;，相对距离 12000 和 3000 有本质区别吗？这一篇解剖这个反直觉的现象：RoPE 的外推失败不是相对性失效，而是低频维度撞进了训练时从未见过的角度分布。讲清病理，才谈得上 <a href=\"ntk-scaling\">NTK 感知缩放</a> 和 <a href=\"position-interpolation\">位置插值</a> 那些疗法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分布外的旋转角度\">核心概念：分布外的旋转角度</h2><p>回到 <a href=\"../mechanism/relative-property\">相对位置性质</a> 的结论：打分是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(q,k,m-n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，只含相对距离。问题在于，模型在训练中只在相对距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\in[0, L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为训练长度）上见过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 的样子。当推理序列变长，出现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\geq L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的组合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(\\cdot,\\cdot,r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 落到从未被优化过的区域，模型对这些相对距离的注意力行为没有任何保证。</p>\n<p>更精确地看单个频率维度：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 对分量的相对相位是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。训练时该相位覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, L\\theta_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。对高频维度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 早已远超 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，训练中相位转了很多圈、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,2\\pi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 全被覆盖，外推时不会遇到新角度。真正的麻烦在<strong>低频维度</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可能连一圈都不到，训练只见过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, L\\theta_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 这一小段角度；推理到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r&gt;L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r\\theta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入训练从未出现的角度区间，模型面对&quot;陌生的旋转&quot;手足无措。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;推理序列 &gt; 训练长度 L&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;出现相对距离 r ≥ L&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{看每个频率维度}&#10;  C --&gt;|高频 θ大| D[&quot;rθ 已覆盖整个 2π&lt;br/&gt;外推安全&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|低频 θ小| E[&quot;训练仅见 [0, Lθ)&lt;br/&gt;rθ 进入未见角度&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;注意力打分落到未优化区域&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;困惑度爆炸 / 输出退化&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"推理序列 &gt; 训练长度 L\"] --&gt; B[\"出现相对距离 r ≥ L\"]\n  B --&gt; C{看每个频率维度}\n  C --&gt;|高频 θ大| D[\"rθ 已覆盖整个 2π&lt;br/&gt;外推安全\"]\n  C --&gt;|低频 θ小| E[\"训练仅见 [0, Lθ)&lt;br/&gt;rθ 进入未见角度\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"注意力打分落到未优化区域\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"困惑度爆炸 / 输出退化\"]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么直接外推会失败-两个叠加的病因\">为什么直接外推会失败：两个叠加的病因</h2><p>第一个病因如上：<strong>低频维度的分布外角度</strong>。这是空间上的问题——某些维度&quot;看到&quot;了训练时不存在的位置指纹。</p>\n<p>第二个病因是<strong>注意力熵/幅度的漂移</strong>。序列变长后，query 要和更多的 key 竞争 Softmax 的归一化预算。即便相对相位都在训练范围内，token 数量的增加也会稀释注意力分布、改变 logits 的整体尺度，使模型习惯的&quot;注意力锐度&quot;发生偏移。YaRN 论文特别指出，简单的线性插值会系统性地压低注意力分数的期望幅度，需要额外的温度校正——这是 <a href=\"position-interpolation\">位置插值</a> 里 YaRN 引入注意力温度的直接动机。</p>\n<p>两个病因叠加，就是&quot;直接外推&quot;几乎必然崩溃的原因：既有分布外角度，又有注意力尺度漂移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"外推-vs-内插-两种截然不同的思路\">外推 vs 内插：两种截然不同的思路</h2><p>面对这个问题，社区分化出两大流派，它们的哲学正好相反。</p>\n<p><strong>外推派（extrapolation）</strong>：保持角度公式不变，寄望模型自己泛化到更大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>。纯 RoPE 属于此类，实践证明它外推能力很弱。ALiBi 因为用的是线性距离惩罚而非旋转，反而外推得更好——但那是另一套编码（见 <a href=\"../foundations/position-encoding-taxonomy\">位置编码谱系</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>内插派（interpolation）</strong>：反其道而行，把推理时更大的位置索引<strong>压缩</strong>回训练见过的范围。位置插值（PI）把位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 缩放为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\cdot L/L&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让最长序列的角度恰好落回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, L\\theta_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。代价是相邻 token 的角度差变小、局部分辨率下降，需要少量微调恢复。NTK 与 YaRN 则是&quot;内插但不牺牲高频分辨率&quot;的精细化版本。</p>\n<p>下表把主要应对手段按&quot;改什么&quot;归类，作为进入后两篇的路线图。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>改什么</th>\n<th>需要微调</th>\n<th>高频分辨率</th>\n<th>典型出处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接外推（原始 RoPE）</td>\n<td>什么都不改</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>RoFormer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置插值 PI</td>\n<td>缩放位置索引</td>\n<td>少量</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>Chen 等 2023</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NTK-aware</td>\n<td>增大 base</td>\n<td>可零样本</td>\n<td>基本保留</td>\n<td>bloc97 2023</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dynamic NTK</td>\n<td>按当前长度动态调 base</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>社区 2023</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NTK-by-parts / YaRN</td>\n<td>按频率分段处理</td>\n<td>少量</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>YaRN, arXiv:2309.00071</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LongRoPE</td>\n<td>搜索每维缩放 + 渐进扩展</td>\n<td>少量</td>\n<td>保留</td>\n<td>微软 2024</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一个量化直觉-base-决定-安全长度\">一个量化直觉：base 决定&quot;安全长度&quot;</h2><p>结合 <a href=\"../mechanism/frequency-bands\">频率带与波长</a>，可以给出一个粗略但有用的判据：一个维度只要满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L&#x27;\\theta_i &lt; 2\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9019em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是目标推理长度），它在整段推理里都没转满一圈，就仍在&quot;训练角度的凸包&quot;附近，相对安全。最低频维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>base</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{d/2-1}\\approx 1/\\text{base}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span>，代入得安全长度约与 base 同量级。这解释了为什么 Llama 3 把 base 提到 50 万——它想让最低频维度的安全长度覆盖 12.8 万乃至更长的目标窗口。这个把 base 当旋钮的思路，正是 <a href=\"ntk-scaling\">NTK 感知缩放</a> 的出发点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RoPE 外推失败的根因不是相对性失效，而是低频维度在长序列上转到训练从未见过的角度。</li>\n<li>高频维度训练时已覆盖整圈、外推安全；低频维度只见过一小段角度，是崩溃的震中。</li>\n<li>第二病因是注意力幅度/熵随序列变长而漂移，需温度校正。</li>\n<li>两大流派：外推派（原样泛化，效果差）与内插派（把位置压回训练范围，PI/NTK/YaRN 属此）。</li>\n<li>base 与&quot;安全长度&quot;同量级——这是把 base 当外推旋钮的量化依据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>频率与波长的基础：<a href=\"../mechanism/frequency-bands\">频率带与波长</a></li>\n<li>第一类疗法：<a href=\"ntk-scaling\">NTK 感知缩放</a></li>\n<li>主流疗法：<a href=\"position-interpolation\">位置插值 (PI/YaRN)</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：外推之外的长上下文手段（稀疏、检索、记忆）见 <a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/\">长上下文技术</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"长度外推之难：为什么 RoPE 出了训练长度就崩","id":"长度外推之难-为什么-rope-出了训练长度就崩"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分布外的旋转角度","id":"核心概念-分布外的旋转角度"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么直接外推会失败：两个叠加的病因","id":"为什么直接外推会失败-两个叠加的病因"},{"level":2,"text":"外推 vs 内插：两种截然不同的思路","id":"外推-vs-内插-两种截然不同的思路"},{"level":2,"text":"一个量化直觉：base 决定\"安全长度\"","id":"一个量化直觉-base-决定-安全长度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"相对位置性质：为什么内积只记得距离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/mechanism/relative-property"},"next":{"title":"NTK 感知缩放：只调一个 base 就把窗口撑长","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/extrapolation/ntk-scaling"}}